# Rebuild x64 Setup after every addition

After any change to KM app files (`app/**`), bump Թարմացում, run `writeIntegrity`, then rebuild **only** `dist\KM_Setup_x64.exe`.

```powershell
powershell.exe -NoLogo -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ".\BUILD_SETUP.ps1"
```

- Do not rebuild x86 Setup unless the user asks.
- Never pack `app\KM_UPDATE_ORIGIN` into Setup.
- Do not copy to `E:\2\KM` unless the user asks.
- Do not skip this rebuild after an app addition.
